id: decisions/022-claim-boundedness
title: "bounded claim or unbounded claim"
kind: decision-frame
record_shape: header
status: draft
authored_by: agent-on-behalf
authored_via: "Claude Code session on Dave's behalf, 2026-09-12; drafted from the JUDGMENTS.md reversal axis 'claim-boundedness'; recommendation is an attributed inference and ratifies nothing"
